    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hămaxŏbĭi</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-bĭoe</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁμαξόβιοι</span> (living, going about in wagons),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a Scythian
				people</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 1, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4,
				12, 25</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 3, 24, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 2,
			2</span></i>).—In sing.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hamaxobio instabilior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 1, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
